id: pm-rust-wdj4
title: Reduce native list and get latency on large indexed trackers
description: "The final 30-run cold-process receipt on a complete 2991-item public tracker copy measured native list p50 4807.6 ms versus oracle 4000.8 ms, and native get p50 4405.4 ms versus oracle 3715.0 ms. This is a heavily contended shared 4-CPU host with effective nice 15, warm filesystem and oracle derived caches; 1-minute load ranged 20.07 to 44.97. The earlier lower-load 22f7fd0 receipt also showed slower native list/get. Investigate selective lookup or validated derived indexes without weakening authoritative read correctness, concurrency or parity. Retain this optimization as a separate follow-up to the orientation command slice."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
tags[3]: follow-up,performance,rust
